            "notes": "# Round 1\n\n# Powers\nI start off with  [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e), but  [No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6) or  [Pinpoint Prescription](item_5cfa07d8-7b5d-42df-a9a8-c6a580acb8bc) can work. Since its Quick Play,  dont worry too much about what power you should be picking.  [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e) works best for this build since it is a sleep build.\n\n# Items\nI usually go for  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) ,  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) and  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6). These wont matter in the next round anyways.\n\n# Strategy\nPlay like a normal Ana, but try to use your sleep as soon as its off cooldown to get that extra HP from  [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e) .",
