            "notes": "# Round 2\n\n# Powers\nI pick  [Venomous](item_594b0c79-5440-475c-b64c-c0295c46d735), as this is the item that will already help your build shine. It may look like it doesnt much at the moment, but in the next round it will.\n\n# Items\nSell everything. You should have enough for this item anyways, so get  [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4) immediately. If you get 9k cash from the first round, you will earn another 10k cash. Use that extra 9k to get  [Lethal Dose](item_b919494d-1a33-408a-ba2b-7e3cc24b59c8). If you dont have enough, get  [Double Dosage](item_80f07e6e-56f9-40a5-9f5e-ba9005998b28). Both items will stay with you until round 5.\n\n# Strategy\nContinue to play Ana regularly, but be more aggressive to enemies who are far from their team. This can work well against aggressive Lucio's, Genji, and Reapers if you are able to kill them before they go into Wraith form.",
