            "notes": "# Round 3\n\n# Powers\n [Time Out](item_34fc2f6c-ecd9-489e-98ca-d08f3eb2fac1) will help with getting high mobility characters (specifically DPS and supports). I cant think of any other power I'd get for this.\n\n# Items\nYou should now have  [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4) ,   [Double Dosage](item_80f07e6e-56f9-40a5-9f5e-ba9005998b28) , and  [Lethal Dose](item_b919494d-1a33-408a-ba2b-7e3cc24b59c8) . If you have leftover cash, get  [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e). Itll help you with mobility which Ana does not have, such as getting out of situations you might die in. But by this point, you should be staying alive well.\n\n# Strategy\nYou can now be aggressive, go on flanks, sleep any squishy, hit them with the nade and watch them blow up. I actually find this build to go well against Mercy, as sleeps are now extremely easy to hit in the air. You only have to somewhat predict where she will go to hit the sleep.",
