            "notes": "# Round 4\n\n# Items\n [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) or  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) can work. Just get whatever you can afford, and in the next round get the item you couldnt get. \n\n# Strategy\nLike last round, be aggressive. You can be even more aggressive and start going on stupid flanks to get anyone, especially since you basically two shot anyone with low HP or little to no survival items. If you miss your sleep, fall back until you have it again by helping your team with heals as you can farm some cash anyways.",
