            "notes": "# Round 5\n\n# Powers\n [My Turn](item_5cea2ccb-c889-4447-8a84-c704c1da1521) will work since you are basically a DPS at this point, and since its for 100% of nano's duration you can probably kill two in the time that you have nano. If you want, [Our Turn](item_6e0fdb41-c00f-41d9-8ec2-1246b34a539a) can be used instead to support your team more. But since you dont have  [Eye of Horus](item_169551ce-e4e5-4a14-9ec4-abdc25673939) its honestly pretty useless.\n\n# Items\nGet whatever you didnt get last round, which is either  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) or  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce).\n\n# Strategy\nGo crazy. Have fun. Win the game.",
